{
  "name": "ocapn",
  "description": "The OCapN suite defines a decentralized architecture for secure distributed object interactions, centering on the Capability Transport Protocol (CapTP) for transparent remote reference management. It facilitates promise pipelining and distributed acyclic garbage collection through an abstract 'netlayer' interface that supports diverse transports from Tor to Inter-Blockchain Communication (IBC). The repository serves as the primary coordination point for formalizing interoperability between major object-capability systems including Agoric and Spritely.",
